## EXAMPLE API ENDPOINT CHANGES

**Before:**
```python
@app.get("/companies/")
def get_all_companies(db: Session = Depends(get_db)):
    return crud.get_all_companies(db)
```

**After:**
```python
@app.get("/companies/")
@require_role("Admin", "Analyst", "Viewer")
@audit_log("VIEW", "Company")
@rate_limit(100)
async def get_all_companies(
    current_user: User = Depends(get_current_user),
    db: Session = Depends(get_db)
):
    # Only return companies user has access to
    companies = crud.get_companies_for_user(db, current_user.id)
    return companies
```

